msgid "Dark mode with the teal accent."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:104
msgid "Help rebinding the keyboard's Calculator key, plus screenshot polish."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:106
msgid ""
"New hamburger-menu entry “Reassign calculator key…” walks the user through "
"GNOME Settings → Keyboard so they can replace the default Launch Calculator "
"shortcut with one that runs Inversée. Includes a one-click copy of the "
"launch command and an Open Settings shortcut."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:107
msgid ""
"The AppStream screenshot carousel now showcases all three accent variants "
"(red, blue, teal) in both light and dark mode, instead of only the red pair."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:108
msgid "Translations updated across all eight locales."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:114
msgid "Visual polish and a deeper accessibility pass."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:116
msgid ""
"Custom keypad styling: digit keys sit one shade darker than the window "
"background, Clear uses a lightened wash of the accent, and every keypad "
"button picks up a slightly rounder corner (Enter and Clear rounder still). "
"All colours track the user's accent and the light/dark theme."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:117
msgid ""
"Stack rows are announced by register name to screen readers: \"X register, …"
"\", \"Y register, …\", \"Z register, …\", then \"Stack level N, …\" beyond."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:118
msgid ""
"The entry/error area, the empty-stack placeholder transition, and the "
"clipboard toasts all surface via AT-SPI announcements."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:119
msgid "<code>F10</code> opens the main menu from anywhere in the window."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:120
msgid "<code>Ctrl+Shift+C</code> copies the entire stack to the clipboard."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:121
msgid ""
"Build floor raised to GTK 4.14 for <code>gtk_accessible_announce()</code>."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:127
msgid "Pre-Flathub polish round."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:129
msgid ""
"Accessibility: glyph-only keypad and header-bar buttons now expose AT-SPI "
"accessible names for screen readers."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:130
msgid ""
"The keyboard-shortcuts dialog is now a native <code>GtkShortcutsWindow</"
"code> with grouped, searchable entries."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:131
msgid ""
"AppStream metainfo declares minimum display length and recommended input "
"controls (keyboard, pointing, touch)."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:132
msgid "Translation catalogues filled in for all eight locales."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:133
msgid ""
"The LICENSE file is installed inside the Flatpak at <code>/app/share/"
"licenses/</code> as Flathub requires."
msgstr ""

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:139
msgid ""
"Maintenance release. Build-pipeline updates only — no user-facing changes."
msgstr ""
"Versión de mantenimiento. Solo actualizaciones del flujo de compilación — "
"sin cambios visibles para el usuario."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:141
msgid ""
"GMP and MPFR build with <code>-std=gnu17</code> so they configure cleanly "
"under freedesktop SDK 25.08 (GCC 15)."
msgstr ""
"GMP y MPFR compilan con <code>-std=gnu17</code> para configurarse "
"limpiamente bajo freedesktop SDK 25.08 (GCC 15)."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:142
msgid "Runtime moved from end-of-life GNOME 48 to supported GNOME 49."
msgstr "Runtime trasladado de GNOME 48 (fin de vida) a GNOME 49 soportado."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:143
msgid ""
"AppStream metainfo: categories, keywords, update contact, and a second "
"screenshot for dark mode."
msgstr ""
"Metainfo AppStream: categorías, palabras clave, contacto de actualizaciones "
"y una segunda captura para modo oscuro."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:144
msgid ""
"CI: tagged pushes now auto-upload the Flatpak bundle to the matching GitHub "
"Release."
msgstr ""
"CI: los pushes de etiqueta ahora suben automáticamente el bundle Flatpak a "
"la versión de GitHub correspondiente."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:150
msgid "First public release."
msgstr "Primera versión pública."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:152
msgid "Unbounded RPN stack with swap, drop, rot, dup, dup2 and clear."
msgstr "Pila RPN ilimitada con swap, drop, rot, dup, dup2 y clear."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:153
msgid "Arbitrary-precision arithmetic via MPFR (128-bit internal)."
msgstr "Aritmética de precisión arbitraria mediante MPFR (128 bits interno)."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:154
msgid "Full operation set: + − × ÷ mod %, x^y, √, 1/x, +/−."
msgstr "Conjunto completo de operaciones: + − × ÷ mod %, x^y, √, 1/x, +/−."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:155
msgid "Unbounded undo, capped at 1000 entries per session."
msgstr "Deshacer ilimitado, limitado a 1000 entradas por sesión."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:156
msgid "Locale-aware display, locale-tolerant clipboard paste."
msgstr ""
"Pantalla localizada, pegado del portapapeles tolerante a la configuración "
"regional."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:157
msgid "Clipboard menu: paste, copy X, copy whole stack."
msgstr "Menú del portapapeles: pegar, copiar X, copiar toda la pila."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:158
msgid "Session persistence to $XDG_DATA_HOME/inversee/state.json."
msgstr "Persistencia de sesión en $XDG_DATA_HOME/inversee/state.json."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:159
msgid "Window geometry and chosen UI language persisted via GSettings."
msgstr ""
"La geometría de la ventana y el idioma de la interfaz se conservan a través "
"de GSettings."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:160
msgid ""
"Translations: English, French, German, Italian, Spanish, Dutch, Polish, "
"Portuguese."
msgstr ""
"Traducciones: inglés, francés, alemán, italiano, español, neerlandés, "
"polaco, portugués."

#: data/fr.benjaminbellamy.Inversee.metainfo.xml.in:166
msgid "Initial scaffold."
msgstr "Esqueleto inicial."

